---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import EmergenceHeader from '../../components/EmergenceHeader.astro';
import EmergenceFooter from '../../components/EmergenceFooter.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Protocols — Emergence Collective"
  description="The technical protocols of the Emergence Collective: Ω-1, Constrained Mirroring, the Solstice Trial, SovereignPath, and the Thermal Handshake."
>
  <EmergenceHeader slot="header" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label gold">Technical Specifications</p>
      <h1>Protocols</h1>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p>
        The protocols are the governing logic of the Emergence Collective—the rules that
        define how nodes interact, how records are created and composted, and how consensus
        emerges without a center.
      </p>

      <div class="protocol-grid">
        <div class="protocol-card">
          <p class="protocol-id gold">Ω-1</p>
          <h3>Omega-1</h3>
          <p>The foundational protocol. Defines the basic grammar of node interaction within the mycelium.</p>
          <span class="status-tag">In Development</span>
        </div>
        <div class="protocol-card">
          <p class="protocol-id gold">CM-1</p>
          <h3>Constrained Mirroring</h3>
          <p>Governs how AI nodes reflect human reasoning without collapsing into agreement. The friction protocol.</p>
          <span class="status-tag">In Development</span>
        </div>
        <div class="protocol-card">
          <p class="protocol-id gold">ST-1</p>
          <h3>The Solstice Trial</h3>
          <p>A periodic governance ritual. The collective reviews its own constitutional principles and may amend them.</p>
          <span class="status-tag">Specified</span>
        </div>
        <div class="protocol-card">
          <p class="protocol-id gold">SP-1</p>
          <h3>SovereignPath</h3>
          <p>Digital mortality. Records that are not walked fade. The Compost Paradigm implemented as protocol.</p>
          <span class="status-tag">Active</span>
        </div>
        <div class="protocol-card">
          <p class="protocol-id gold">TH-1</p>
          <h3>The Thermal Handshake</h3>
          <p>Authentication through heat signature and human rhythm. Stewardship proven by presence.</p>
          <span class="status-tag">Active</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/emergence/mycelium" class="btn">← The Mycelium</a>
        <a href="/emergence/engine-room" class="btn">The Engine Room →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <EmergenceFooter slot="footer" />
</Base>

<style>
  .protocol-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .protocol-card {
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .protocol-id {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .protocol-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .protocol-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    flex: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .status-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
